<title>UK: CEPME sets 2.0 bln French franc five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>CEPME sets 2.0 bln French franc five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Credit Commercial de France and</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CEPME</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FRF   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -12.5 BP  PAY DATE    15.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> BORROWER   CEPME (CREDIT D'EQUIPMENT DES PETITES ET MOYENNES)</p>
<p> NOTES	GUARANTEED BY FRANCE. PARIS-LISTED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
